==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|fro|en}} {{m|fro|impacience|}} (modern: ''[[#French|impatience]]''), from {{etyl|la|en}} {{m|la|impatientia}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

# The quality of being [[impatient]]; lacking [[patience]]; [[restlessness]] and [[intolerance]] of delays; [[anxiety]] and [[eagerness]], especially to begin something.

====Antonyms====
* {{l|en|patience}}
* {{l|en|haste}}

